{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shopping Nightmares is a top-down survival horror game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off enemies using a variety of weapons and survive using different items that you will find as you explore each floor of <strong>The Negative</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127890/extras/f64302b890d978bfcd28863d583205f5.poster.avif?t=1762541915\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127890/extras/f64302b890d978bfcd28863d583205f5.webm?t=1762541915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127890/extras/f64302b890d978bfcd28863d583205f5.mp4?t=1762541915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your flashlight</strong> to guide yourself, and use your weapons to fend off different entities that may try to attack you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127890/extras/a8bbf35b499970fef11c2ebf0299261e.poster.avif?t=1762541915\" width=576 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127890/extras/a8bbf35b499970fef11c2ebf0299261e.webm?t=1762541915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127890/extras/a8bbf35b499970fef11c2ebf0299261e.mp4?t=1762541915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your inventory</strong> using your cursor, and use items whenever you need, make sure to be picky though, you only have <stro